DESCRIPTION:JIMBO is a multi-disciplinary performance artist and designer\,
  most known for his drag persona JIMBO the Drag Clown!\n\nJIMBO has been fe
 atured on three seasons of  Rupaul's Drag Race  and is the head of his su
 ccessful design house\, House of JIMBO\, a clothing brand\, merchandise ret
 ailer and special events producer.\n\nHis core values and philosophies cent
 re on choosing joy\, sharing happiness and giving love. He is a storyteller
  and clown with a message of love\, tolerance and acceptance. He encourages
  people to embrace their weirdness and to find strength in their uniqueness
  and spread awesomeness through what brings them joy.\n\nJIMBO was the brea
 k-out star of  Canada's Drag Race: Season One \, where his outstanding per
 formance\, shocking elimination and iconic exit created an immediate fan fa
 vourite. Following his success on  Canada's Drag Race \, JIMBO was cast on
   Rupaul's Drag Race :  UK vs The World \,  Season One  after which he 
 embarked on his first world tour of 17 countries. Most recently JIMBO compe
 ted and won  Rupaul's Drag Race All Stars 8\,  and is currently completin
 g his second world tour\, which has taken him around the US\, UK\, South Am
 erica and parts of Europe with over 100 North American and Australian dates
  still to come!\n\nJIMBO is also a musician\, having written and released s
 everal singles\, and plans for a debut album. JIMBO is also a stand up come
 dian\, having toured the UK as a part of the  MP Present: Hater’s Roast 
 Tour  and more was recently featured in a World Of Wonder stand up comedy 
 special as one of his legendary winning Snatch game characters\, Joan River
 s. JIMBO is currently writing and producing his first ‘One Queen Show’ 
 featuring his characters and set to original music.\n\nPrior to Drag Race\,
  JIMBO was working as a costume and production designer for film and theatr
 e. His unique vision and style combining clowning\, fashion\, performance a
 nd business has elevated JIMBO to one of the most well known and successful
  artists in his field.\n\nHis core…\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/c
 omedy-atlas/event/special-event-jimbo-the-drag-clown/
